<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASTAD, Sweden 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results from the Swedish Open tennis tournament on Friday.</p>
<p>Carlos Costa (Spain) beat Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Jeff Tarango (United States) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Magnus Larsson (Sweden) 6-4 (Larsson retired)</p>
<p>Juan-Antonio Marin (Spain) beat Thomas Nydahl (Sweden) 6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
